OL,4,CNHS boss warns of 'horrible spike' in  
OL,5,Cflu as hospital admissions surge       
OL,6,GA surge in severe cases of flu has     
OL,7,Gprompted health officials in England   
OL,8,Gto urge those most at risk to get      
OL,9,Gvaccinated as soon as possible.        
OL,11,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)  
OL,12,Fsaid hospital admission rates had      
OL,13,Fsoared by almost 80% over the last     
OL,14,Fweek to the highest at this time of    
OL,15,Fyear since before the Covid pandemic.  
